switch up which dog was talking. So,

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.640
we'll give it a watch and you'll see

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:16.920
what I mean.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:18.840
So, here is a question.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:22.920
Who has it harder?

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:24.880
Dogs or humans? Dogs, definitely dogs.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:27.120
So, yes. If your first generation AI

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:29.680
clip is not perfect, my best advice

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:31.240
would be to try again before you assume

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:33.360
that there is something wrong with your

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:35.880
prompt. Because if you try again, you

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:38.000
might get a very very different result.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:39.400
And by the way, if you are enjoying this

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.480
video and you are learning something

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:43.480
new, please consider giving it a like.

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:45.560
Liking my videos does genuinely support

